{"1564840": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dreams Of Adventure", "steam_appid": 1564840, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "dlc": [1566110], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dreams Of Adventure brings you in a world of medival fantasy where you chose how to play and impact the world around you. Will you help a person in need? Want them to pay you for help? Perhaps... you end their life and take the bellongings...? The choice is yours! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into a living world where every choice shapes your fate.</strong><br><br>I’m building an open-world, second-life RPG focused on realism and player freedom. Survival matters—eat, drink, sleep, or face the consequences. Every decision, from small interactions to major quests, pushes your story toward one of multiple endings.<br><br>After 1150+ hours of development and investing heavily into assets, the game already offers around <strong>20 hours of gameplay</strong>, with much more on the way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >World &amp; Exploration​</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >World map (150x120, expanding up to 500x500+)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >24 world locations with 170+ interiors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1000+ interactive objects (search, loot, discover)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fog of War system for immersive exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day/Night cycle that <strong>changes gameplay</strong>, quests, and access</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Gameplay &amp; Systems​</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >200 quests (and growing)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival mechanics: Hunger, Thirst, Sleep</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prison system, lockpicking, stealing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting, alchemy, cooking, fishing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Item weight &amp; banking system for realism</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic consequences: escape penalties, stat loss, branching events</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat &amp; Progression​</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 unique classes with distinct playstyles:</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sellsword, Cultist, Paladin, Ranger, Bandit, Cleric, Sorcerer, Corruptor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive spellcasting (timed input system)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spell cooldowns and tactical combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficulty modes from casual to brutal</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Extras &amp; Features​</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blackjack mini-game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchasable homes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed loot &amp; XP breakdown after battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >700+ items, weapons, and gear</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is just the beginning.</strong><br>I’m actively expanding the world, adding companions, quests, and deeper systems.<br><br>If you enjoy immersive RPGs where your choices truly matter, give it a try—and I’d really value your feedback as the game evolves.<br><br>There is lots to do. Some locations aren't done yet. Not all areas have sound and some areas dont have battle sequences. Enemies will be scaled, sound added.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dreams Of Adventure brings you in a world of medival fantasy where you chose how to play and impact the world around you. Will you help a person in need? Want them to pay you for help? Perhaps... you end their life and take the bellongings...? The choice is yours! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into a living world where every choice shapes your fate.</strong><br><br>I’m building an open-world, second-life RPG focused on realism and player freedom. Survival matters—eat, drink, sleep, or face the consequences. Every decision, from small interactions to major quests, pushes your story toward one of multiple endings.<br><br>After 1150+ hours of development and investing heavily into assets, the game already offers around <strong>20 hours of gameplay</strong>, with much more on the way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >World &amp; Exploration​</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >World map (150x120, expanding up to 500x500+)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >24 world locations with 170+ interiors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1000+ interactive objects (search, loot, discover)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fog of War system for immersive exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day/Night cycle that <strong>changes gameplay</strong>, quests, and access</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Gameplay &amp; Systems​</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >200 quests (and growing)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival mechanics: Hunger, Thirst, Sleep</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prison system, lockpicking, stealing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting, alchemy, cooking, fishing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Item weight &amp; banking system for realism</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic consequences: escape penalties, stat loss, branching events</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat &amp; Progression​</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 unique classes with distinct playstyles:</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sellsword, Cultist, Paladin, Ranger, Bandit, Cleric, Sorcerer, Corruptor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive spellcasting (timed input system)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spell cooldowns and tactical combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficulty modes from casual to brutal</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"